   "sol": [
    "$\\overrightarrow{BA}=(-4;0)$, $\\overrightarrow{BC}=(-4;3)$.",
    "$\\overrightarrow{BA}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{BC}=16$, $|\\overrightarrow{BA}|=4$, $|\\overrightarrow{BC}|=5$.",
